                <pb facs="0913" n="811" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg811"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Russell to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Willemstad</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-08-22"><hi rendition="#italic">August
                        22</hi></date>.<lb/>(Received Aug 25, 1907.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>My formal proposition for arbitration of pending cases was presented on the 13th
                    of this month Minister for foreign affairs answered under date of 20th instant
                    that, in accordance with instructions from the President, “the Government of
                    Venezuela adheres wholly to its position as stated in its memorandum of April 23
                    and in the note of July 24 last, in answer to the memorandum of March 30 and to
                    your note of July 9.”</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
